From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chris Blake <chrisrblake93@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 18:27:35 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: thermal: rockchip: add RK3308B-S TSADC

The RK3308B-S has a different TSADC from the RK3308: a single channel
with a linear 12-bit code and no inverted output. Add a compatible
for it.

Signed-off-by: Chris Blake <chrisrblake93@gmail.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/thermal/rockchip-thermal.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/thermal/rockchip-thermal.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/thermal/rockchip-thermal.yaml
index 9fa5c4c49..82ee8d876 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/thermal/rockchip-thermal.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/thermal/rockchip-thermal.yaml
@@ -17,6 +17,7 @@ properties:
       - rockchip,px30-tsadc
       - rockchip,rk3228-tsadc
       - rockchip,rk3288-tsadc
+      - rockchip,rk3308bs-tsadc
       - rockchip,rk3328-tsadc
       - rockchip,rk3368-tsadc
       - rockchip,rk3399-tsadc
